    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i cant even go to the grocery store anymore. i saw a group of students from my old uni yesterday and i just had to turn around and run the other way. it’s like everyone knows. everything i worked for is just... gone. i look in the mirror and i dont even see myself anymore, i just see the person everyone is talking about. it feels like i've already died, you know? like i'm just a ghost walking around.",
